 "name_en": "Convergent Invoicing – Invoice Correction Processing (2BE)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Convergent Invoicing – Invoice Correction Processing (2BE)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio67bf01ffea7d418999c5a33d0c5a1887\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67bf01ffea7d418999c5a33d0c5a1887__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Invoice correction processing allows you to correct existing invoices using billing requests. You can create debit and credit memos correcting line item amounts or billable item amounts.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67bf01ffea7d418999c5a33d0c5a1887__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a billing request</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain amount of a line item or a billable item</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release a billing request</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67bf01ffea7d418999c5a33d0c5a1887__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Simplify invoice correction</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create credit or debit memo for invoices in total or per line item</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集中开发票 – 发票更正处理 (2BE)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio67bf01ffea7d418999c5a33d0c5a1887\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67bf01ffea7d418999c5a33d0c5a1887__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">发票更正处理允许您使用开票请求更正现有发票。您可以创建借项和贷项凭证，以更正行项目金额或可开票项目金额。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67bf01ffea7d418999c5a33d0c5a1887__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建开票请求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护行项目或可开票项目的金额。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批开票请求</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67bf01ffea7d418999c5a33d0c5a1887__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">简化发票更正</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为总计或每个行项目的发票创建贷项凭单或借项凭单。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
